full-query: "As a Database Engineer, you have implemented a disaster recovery strategy for a data analytics application with a multi-regional architecture. To validate the effectiveness of the disaster recovery plan, you must perform periodic tests. Which of the following options is the best approach for testing the disaster recovery plan while minimizing the impact on production workloads and ensuring accurate test results?"
